.\" The .TH version and date are placeholders, filled in by the packaging
.\" (scripts/dist.sh, ppa/debian/rules) from the release tag and its commit date.
.TH NODE\-TRACKER 1 "@DATE@" "node-tracker @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
node\-tracker \- alert when a Bitcoin node falls behind the chain tip
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B node\-tracker
.I command
.RI [ flags ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B node\-tracker
compares a Bitcoin node's block height with independent views of the chain
tip (Esplora servers such as \%mempool.space and \%blockstream.info, or other
bitcoind nodes) and with the node's own header height.
When the node falls more than a threshold behind, cannot be reached, or no
reference answers, it sends a Telegram message, and another one when the
node is back in sync.
Changes are debounced, and undelivered alerts are kept and retried.
.PP
Only the read\-only
.B getblockchaininfo
RPC is called.
Secrets (RPC password, bot token) are read from files or environment
variables, never from the configuration file.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B run
Run as a daemon: one tick right away, then one every
.BR interval .
State and pending alerts are saved after each tick.
.TP
.B once
Run one tick and exit; for cron or a systemd timer.
Uses the same state file as
.BR run .
.TP
.B check
Dry run: sample every target and print a table.
No state is read or written and no alert is sent.
.TP
.B report
Send a status report of every target to every notifier, whatever the state.
.TP
.BR test\-notify " [\fIname\fR]"
Send a test message to the notifier
.IR name ,
or to all notifiers.
.TP
.B version
Print the version, commit, build time and Go version.
.TP
.B help
Print a short usage message.
.SH OPTIONS
Flags follow the command, e.g.
.BR "node\-tracker once \-log\-level debug" .
.B node\-tracker
.I command
.B \-h
lists the flags of a command.
.TP
.BI \-config " file"
Configuration file.
Default:
.IR $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/node\-tracker/config.yaml ,
that is
.I ~/.config/node\-tracker/config.yaml
unless
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
is set.
.TP
.BI \-state " file"
State file, for
.B run
and
.B once
only.
Default: the configuration's
.BR state_file ,
else
.IR $XDG_STATE_HOME/node\-tracker/state.json ,
that is
.IR ~/.local/state/node\-tracker/state.json .
.TP
.BI \-log\-format " format"
.B text
(default) or
.BR json .
Logs go to standard error.
.TP
.BI \-log\-level " level"
.BR debug ,
.B info
(default),
.B warn
or
.BR error .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success; every target is in sync.
.TP
.B 1
Failure, e.g. the state file could not be read or written, an alert is
still undelivered after
.BR once ,
or the run was interrupted.
.TP
.B 2
Usage or configuration error.
.TP
.B 3
Another node\-tracker holds the lock on the state file
.RB ( run
or
.BR once );
this run did nothing.
.TP
.B 4
A target was observed out of sync
.RB ( once ,
.BR check ,
.BR report ).
This is the monitored state, not a failure: alerts follow the debounced
state.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.BR HTTP_PROXY ", " HTTPS_PROXY ", " NO_PROXY
Proxies for HTTP requests;
.B socks5://
works, e.g. for Tor.
See the configuration reference for per\-endpoint proxies and .onion nodes.
.TP
.BR XDG_CONFIG_HOME ", " XDG_STATE_HOME
Base directories of the default configuration and state files.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/node\-tracker/config.yaml
Default configuration file.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/node\-tracker/state.json
Default state file: target states and undelivered alerts.
It is locked through
.IR state.json.lock .
.TP
.IR /etc/node\-tracker/config.yaml ", " /var/lib/node\-tracker/state.json
Configuration and state of the systemd system service.
.SH SIGNALS
.B SIGINT
and
.B SIGTERM
stop
.B run
and
.BR once .
A tick interrupted while sampling leaves the state unchanged; alerts not
yet delivered stay queued in the state file.
.SH EXAMPLES
Check that every node, reference and notifier is reachable:
.PP
.RS
.EX
node\-tracker check
node\-tracker test\-notify
.EE
.RE
.PP
Run one tick every minute from cron:
.PP
.RS
.EX
* * * * *  node\-tracker once 2>&1 | logger \-t node\-tracker
.EE
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
The configuration reference, operations guide and design notes in
.IR /usr/share/doc/node\-tracker/docs/ ,
or at
.UR https://github.com/al\-maisan/node\-tracker
.UE .
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at
.UR https://github.com/al\-maisan/node\-tracker/issues
.UE ;
security problems privately, see SECURITY.md.
